gray-700","children":"Merci pour tout : l'écoute, la patience, le calme, les conseils, le parcours de sophrologie personnalisé et individualisé. En synthèse : aucune hésitation à aller voir Mme Fabrici."}]]}],"$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21"]}],"$L22"]}]}],null,"$L23"]}]
